WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.174 --> 00:00:10.130
Open Pages and choose the page you want to edit.

2
00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:15.593
The page tree is the starting point for page content edits.

3
00:00:15.593 --> 00:00:23.019
Open a page editor, then use the plus action in a slot to add a widget.

4
00:00:23.019 --> 00:00:30.214
Use the settings action on the widget row to edit its configuration.
